      "recipe": "native/gui/linux.py",
      "platforms": [
        "linux-x64"
      ]
    }
  },
  "metadata": {
    "linux_gui": "All generic GUI owners are independently desktop.enable gated, not apps.enable or desktop.niri.enable. Existing desktop.json owns JetBrains Mono Nerd Font, grim and slurp; no duplicate theme/font/runtime ownership. Current official Capacities .deb supersedes the former AppImage/NixGL delivery. Physical workstation graphics/sandbox/portal/profile gates remain explicit."
  }
}
